Exception</a></code> - if an endpoint index value is out of range
         <code>(fromIndex &lt; 0 || toIndex &gt; size)</code></dd>
<dd><code><a href=3D"https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/lang/Il=
legalArgumentException.html" title=3D"class in java.lang">IllegalArgumentEx=
ception</a></code> - if the endpoint indices are out of order
